YS"/><HBox spacing="10"><Button text="Open" onAction="#openSaved" minWidth="-Infinity"/><Button text="Delete" onAction="#deleteSaved" styleClass="danger" minWidth="-Infinity"/></HBox></VBox></VBox></ScrollPane>
